Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:36:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] HPCA: expandable (3 to 12 slices of 3 component slots),
 Active Coolers cool by coolant (PCB 2, supercooled 8 to 20) (7.5.3-af9.11)

- The array's component section repeats 3 to 12 times (9 to 36 slots); the controller screen draws the whole grid, the
  client finds the slices by walking back from the controller.
- Active Coolers: the cooling of a coolant at the full 8 mB/t is a table (HPCAMachine.registerCoolant): PCB Coolant and any
  other fluid of the coolants tag 2, supercooled hydrogen / argon / xenon / endion 8 / 12 / 16 / 20. The strongest coolant
  present is drawn first, and a stronger coolant needs less fluid to hold the temperature.
